**5 Important Java Tips:**

1. Learn OOPs concepts properly – Class, Object, Inheritance, Polymorphism, Encapsulation and Abstraction.
2. Practice Java Collections – ArrayList, HashMap and HashSet.
3. Understand Exception Handling – try, catch, finally, throw and throws.
4. Start DSA with Java – Arrays, Strings, Searching, Sorting, Linked List, Stack and Queue.
5. Practice coding regularly – Don’t only learn theory; write programs and solve problems yourself.
